Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.18,0:02:49.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Uma campanha especial para a nova loja de jogos!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.67,0:02:52.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Aqui. Obrigada!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.92,0:02:53.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.13,0:02:57.44,Main Italics,,0,0,0,,Meu nome é Kirisaki Kyouko.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.44,0:03:02.56,Main Italics,,0,0,0,,Sou muito ocupada para o amor, mas ainda assim...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.14,0:03:04.38,Main Italics,,0,0,0,,Me acho linda!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.12,0:03:06.60,Main Italics,,0,0,0,,Ah, eu disse!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.60,0:03:08.95,Main Italics,,0,0,0,,Hoje estou trabalhando\N para divulgar uma campanha.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.78,0:03:10.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.29,0:03:13.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Kyouko-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.63,0:03:15.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Kyouko-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.39,0:03:19.42,Main Italics,,0,0,0,,Como sempre, meu fiel ajudante, Ikemen-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.70,0:03:21.67,Main Italics,,0,0,0,,Está tão lindo hoje...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.31,0:03:25.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Kyouko-kun, não é hora de ficar\N com essa cara de apaixonada!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.91,0:03:27.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Então que hora é agora?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.83,0:03:29.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Hora de encrenca.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.34,0:03:30.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Encrenca?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.12,0:03:37.52,Main,,0,0,0,,O Misterioso General Mojack, da organização\N maligna, Uzas, apareceu de novo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.04,0:03:41.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Aquele General Mojack?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.75,0:03:43.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Espera, quem é esse?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.95,0:03:55.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Sou o General Mojack, da organização\N maligna que vai dominar o planeta, Uzas!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.54,0:03:56.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Prazer em conhecê-lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.79,0:03:57.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Prazer em conhecê-la!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.96,0:03:59.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Prazer em conhecê-lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.29,0:04:00.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Prazer em conhecê-lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.55,0:04:01.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Prazer em conhecê-lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.59,0:04:02.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Prazer em conhecê-la!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.67,0:04:03.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Prazer em conhecê-la!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.59,0:04:04.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Prazer em conhecê-lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.42,0:04:05.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Muito prazer em conhecê-lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.84,0:04:06.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Muito prazer em conhecê-lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.76,0:04:16.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Como esse misterioso General\N Mojack da Uzas, chegou na cidade?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.06,0:04:17.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Bem...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.90,0:04:22.28,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Próxima parada, Shopping\N do 2º Distrito, Rua Arcade.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.28,0:04:26.78,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Costeletas de porco, carne moída\N e croquetes no Açougue Rozawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.78,0:04:28.53,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Lá também vende salada.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.21,0:04:42.46,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Prazer em conhecê-la!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.46,0:04:43.30,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Prazer em conhecê-lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.17,0:04:45.13,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Aquele é...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.68,0:04:52.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Parece que a maligna Uzas sofreu uns cortes\N no orçamento e não pode mais andar de táxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.89,0:04:54.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso é ruim.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.14,0:04:56.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Uma organização maligna aparecendo não é bom!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.44,0:04:58.23,Main,,0,0,0,,É, tem razão.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.65,0:05:04.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Bom... como o General Mojack\N planeja conquistar a Terra?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.19,0:05:06.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Assim.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.83,0:05:13.66,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Prazer em conhecê-lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.12,0:05:14.91,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Prazer em conhecê-lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.25,0:05:17.00,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Prazer em conhecê-lo! Ah, por favor, sem tirar fotos.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:18.37,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Prazer em conhecê-lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.37,0:05:19.37,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Prazer em conhecê-lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.37,0:05:20.46,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Prazer em conhecê-lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.46,0:05:21.33,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Prazer em conhecê-lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.33,0:05:22.21,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Prazer em conhecê-lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.21,0:05:24.34,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Prazer em conhecê-lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.96,0:05:28.01,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Chega de cumprimentos.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.01,0:05:31.22,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Já está na hora de conquistar os cabelos da Terra!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.97,0:05:33.10,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Mojack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.47,0:05:36.93,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Mojack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.94,0:05:41.65,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Mojack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.49,0:05:51.57,Main,,0,0,0,,E é isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.78,0:05:54.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Tentando fazer todo mundo ficar\N com um black-power fora de moda...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.62,0:05:55.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Esse cara é um problema.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.99,0:05:57.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Kyouko-chan, mude de roupa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.83,0:05:59.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Shirone, eu entendi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.04,0:06:03.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Lá!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.51,0:06:09.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Shirone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.34,0:06:11.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Roupa Mágica!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.10,0:06:15.89,Main Italics,,0,0,0,,Preciso me trocar rápido!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.19,0:06:29.32,Main,,0,0,0,,O que está fazendo aqui?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.74,0:06:32.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, não!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.29,0:06:46.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Não tem jeito.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.01,0:06:50.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Esse é...!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.01,0:06:58.31,Main Italics,,0,0,0,,Kyouko-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.19,0:07:08.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Kyouko-kun, o que você está fazendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.07,0:07:10.28,Main,,0,0,0,,O que você está fazendo aqui?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.11,0:07:15.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Kyouko-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.16,0:07:19.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Idiota, o que você está olhando?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.41,0:07:23.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Ikemen-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.29,0:07:26.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Cuide disto.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.75,0:07:31.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Mágica Kyouko!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.26,0:07:41.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, você é o espião tarado!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.02,0:07:44.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Ainda está aqui?! Pervertido!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.02,0:07:42.31,Main Alt,,0,0,0,,Não, não é isso...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.52,0:07:46.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Volte aqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.35,0:07:47.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Prazer em conhecê-lo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.61,0:07:51.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Mojack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.78,0:07:55.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Mojack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.78,0:07:58.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Mojo Mojack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.95,0:08:06.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Todas as pessoas vão ficar com cabelo afro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.88,0:08:10.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Pare, General Mojack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.80,0:08:12.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Essa voz é...!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.88,0:08:16.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Não importa o problema, eu resolvo queimando!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.76,0:08:20.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Chama Mágica Kyouko - A Garota Explosiva!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.47,0:08:22.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Esperava por você!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.27,0:08:29.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Inimiga da organização maligna\N Uzas, receba o cabelo afro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.73,0:08:35.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Tentando conquistar o mundo\N fazendo todos ficarem de cabelo afro é...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.53,0:08:38.03,Main,,0,0,0,,...Festival da Tanga de Sumô no Osmond Place!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.99,0:08:41.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Festival da Tanga de Sumô no Osmond Place?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.87,0:08:43.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Só pra constar, isso não significa nada!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.95,0:08:46.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Diga algo com sentido!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.58,0:08:49.29,Main,,0,0,0,,O problema não é a falta de sentido!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.29,0:08:51.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Não importa contra o que, eu protegerei a Terra!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.00,0:08:54.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Vai proteger, não importa o quê?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.42,0:08:58.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Queimarei seu coração! Uma chama\N pura e vermelha que protege a Terra!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.14,0:09:02.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Mágica Kyouko - Chama Sexy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:09.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Mesmo que seja o General Mojack, curve-se para mim!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.61,0:09:11.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Mojack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.99,0:09:25.12,Main Italics,,0,0,0,,C-Calcinha!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.71,0:09:29.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Você viu, não foi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.13,0:09:35.05,Main,,0,0,0,,A ameaça foi eliminada!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.05,0:09:38.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Restaurei a paz mais uma vez!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.24,0:10:01.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Vou contar pra minha mãe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.28,0:10:04.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Voltou ao normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.08,0:10:09.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Ainda bem!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.46,0:10:11.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Viva!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.46,0:10:14.29,Main,,0,0,0,,É isso aí!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.59,0:10:17.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Mágica Kyouko.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.67,0:10:18.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.88,0:10:22.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Sou chefe do corpo de bombeiros da cidade.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.59,0:10:23.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Obrigado pelo trabalho duro!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.80,0:10:26.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Está presa por violar as leis!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.23,0:10:28.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Hã?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.27,0:10:30.31,Main,,0,0,0,,O que estão fazendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.98,0:10:32.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Seus ataques são perigosos!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.77,0:10:37.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Você pode queimar lojas e mercados com sua chama.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.98,0:10:39.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Tomarei cuidado!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.32,0:10:41.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Só isso não adianta!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.66,0:10:42.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Sem essa...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.70,0:10:45.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu uso para proteger a paz da Terra.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.28,0:10:49.29,Main,,0,0,0,,A segurança das lojas e mercados\N é mais importante que a paz da Terra!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.12,0:10:54.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Desculpe-me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.75,0:10:57.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Não será perdoada só com um pedido de desculpas!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.21,0:10:59.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Então como...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.76,0:11:03.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos discutir isso ali na loja de sushi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.22,0:11:05.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim, senhor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.80,0:11:08.39,Main Italics,,0,0,0,,Só vamos comer sushi, então...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.39,0:11:10.64,Main Italics,,0,0,0,,Não farei nada, então...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:13.14,Main Italics,,0,0,0,,não faça nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.32,0:11:23.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Mágica Kyouko-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.57,0:11:24.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Sim?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.37,0:11:29.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Me queime com a sua chama!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.16,0:11:35.63,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Mais! Mais! Queime mais!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.29,0:11:40.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Que diabos você quer?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.22,0:11:48.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Com licença!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.60,0:11:55.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Mágica Kyouko, não me subestime.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.36,0:12:02.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Ikemen-senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.90,0:12:05.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Aqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.28,0:12:07.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Tome aqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.12,0:12:11.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Ikemen-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.54,0:12:12.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Kyouko-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.83,0:12:15.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Por que está vestindo minhas roupas?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.54,0:12:16.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Tenho um bom motivo...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:18.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Devolva, por favor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.42,0:12:21.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Achei você!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.22,0:12:25.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Seu idiota, espere!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.22,0:12:27.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu não!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.77,0:12:39.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Proteger a paz não é fácil.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.69,0:12:44.57,Main,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.15,0:12:47.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu... consegui...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.45,0:12:49.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Chefe!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.28,0:12:52.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Não importa o problema, eu resolvo queimando!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.41,0:12:59.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Chama da Mágica Kyouko - A Garota Explosiva!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.51,0:13:09.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Revelarei a verdadeira\N identidade da Mágica Kyouko.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.76,0:13:11.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Sem essa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.31,0:13:13.68,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Aqui tem alguns lenços.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.06,0:13:14.97,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Aqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.97,0:13:18.31,Flashback,,0,0,0,,A verdadeira Mágica Kyouko é... ela!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.77,0:13:20.69,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Eu...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.98,0:13:25.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Se acontecer isso, estarei encrencada!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.53,0:13:27.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Se é assim, me queime.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.24,0:13:29.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.20,0:13:35.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Depois de me queimar, vou te comprar uma saia.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.62,0:13:37.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Não preciso disso.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.25,0:13:42.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Próxima parada: Nozawazu no Terceiro Distrito.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.00,0:13:47.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Após a saída, a bela vista de Nozawazu...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.85,0:13:58.10,Main,,0,0,0,,General Mojack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.65,0:14:05.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Quem deixou o meu filho careca?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:10.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Ela!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.28,0:14:13.53,Main,,0,0,0,,A mãe do General Mojack?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.95,0:14:16.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Como se atreve a fazer isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.29,0:14:18.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Não deixei ele careca!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:19.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Estava protegendo a Terra!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.91,0:14:22.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Você é uma garotinha que não sabe de nada, né?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.17,0:14:23.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Ei, ei, ei.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.54,0:14:28.21,Main,,0,0,0,,A Mágica Kyouko-kun teve um motivo para isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.21,0:14:29.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Quem é você, velho?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.97,0:14:34.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Sou o chefe do corpo de bombeiros dessa cidade.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.89,0:14:37.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Mojack!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.27,0:14:47.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Minha cabeça está cheia de cabelo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.69,0:14:49.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Chefe?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.90,0:14:52.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Mágica Kyouko-kun, vamos comemorar!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.78,0:14:55.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu finalmente tenho cabelo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.03,0:14:56.91,Main,,0,0,0,,E tenho muito cabelo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.70,0:15:00.29,Main,,0,0,0,,O nome dele é...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.96,0:15:02.62,Main,,0,0,0,,General Mojack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.00,0:15:05.46,Main,,0,0,0,,General Mojack, obrigado!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.09,0:15:09.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Mãe, eu fui agradecido!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.34,0:15:14.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso mesmo! Você sempre foi amado por todos!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.22,0:15:18.31,Main,,0,0,0,,É? Sou amado por todos?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.31,0:15:20.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Não há criança má neste mundo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.81,0:15:21.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Chefe!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.93,0:15:23.19,Main,,0,0,0,,O quê?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.19,0:15:24.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos brincar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.23,0:15:25.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Ok!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.52,0:15:26.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos dançar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.11,0:15:28.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.83,0:15:43.21,Main,,0,0,0,,É muito bom que o General Mojack\N tenha arrumado um amigo, né?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.21,0:15:44.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Não!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.96,0:15:45.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Mãe...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.83,0:15:48.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Não sou mãe, sou a "mamãe"!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.34,0:15:49.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Socorro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.96,0:15:51.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Kyouko-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.42,0:15:53.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Ikemen-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.93,0:15:54.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Volte aqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.88,0:15:56.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Já disse que não!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.47,0:15:57.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Kyouko-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.05,0:16:00.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Quero dizer, Mágica Kyouko, faça algo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.14,0:16:02.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Quem é ele?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.77,0:16:04.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Ele é o meu senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.48,0:16:06.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Ikemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.44,0:16:08.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Não é esse ai, aquele ali!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.07,0:16:14.82,Main,,0,0,0,,É alguém que estava usando\N o banheiro público da estação.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.55,0:16:35.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Querido!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.09,0:16:37.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Querido?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.39,0:16:43.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Querido! Onde você estava?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.65,0:16:49.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Você...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.57,0:16:58.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Papai...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.66,0:17:01.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Onde estava?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.49,0:17:02.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Eu parti numa viagem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.79,0:17:03.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Mentira!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.54,0:17:04.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Foi uma mentira.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.16,0:17:06.46,Main,,0,0,0,,A verdade, então?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.62,0:17:08.79,Main,,0,0,0,,A verdade é....
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.42,0:17:14.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Fugi com a mulher da barraca de\N yakisoba em frente ao estádio de corrida.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.21,0:17:19.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Vamos fazer um yakisoba\N delicioso em Fujinomiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.77,0:17:29.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Mas ela me deu um fora em Fujinomiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.61,0:17:38.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Você! Lixo é ali atrás!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.62,0:17:48.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Foi duro para você, querido.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.33,0:17:54.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Fiz você sofrer sem necessidade...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.76,0:17:59.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Seu bundão! Do que está falando?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.84,0:18:02.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Se bater muito, seu marido vai...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.26,0:18:03.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.68,0:18:04.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Deixa-a...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.64,0:18:06.02,Main,,0,0,0,,fazer o que...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.31,0:18:07.93,Main,,0,0,0,,quiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.93,0:18:08.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Tá.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.23,0:18:11.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Me deixando de lado!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.73,0:18:14.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Ei... está tudo bem?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.48,0:18:16.53,Main,,0,0,0,,Está, não se preocupe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.65,0:18:22.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Desculpe, mas... você... poderia fazer uma coisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.57,0:18:24.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Mesmo me pedindo...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.41,0:18:28.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Cansou?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.91,0:18:30.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Não, posso continuar!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.46,0:18:32.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Mamãe, perdoe o papai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.50,0:18:35.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Mojack...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.13,0:18:38.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Mojack...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.80,0:18:42.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Esse é...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.64,0:18:47.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Esse é... Mojack!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:51.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Isso. O mesmo que você abandonou!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.31,0:18:54.86,Main,,0,0,0,,General Mojack...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.11,0:18:58.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Papai...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.99,0:19:03.87,Main,,0,0,0,,Antigamente você era deste tamanho!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.54,0:19:09.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Pequeno assim?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.08,0:19:13.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Está certo, como Mojack pediu eu vou te perdoar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.75,0:19:16.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Mamãe! Ainda não perdoou o papai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.96,0:19:21.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Bom, eu o traí também.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.43,0:19:29.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Com o rapaz da loja pachinko.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.56,0:19:34.06,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Vamos cantar no karaokê! Vamos! Vamos!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.56,0:19:33.39,Main Alt,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HED1472&}Mas! Mas! Mas!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.56,0:19:37.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Aquele empregado da\N pachinko é meu irmão mais velho.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.65,0:19:40.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Ele já me contou isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.15,0:19:46.03,Flashback,,0,0,0,,A mãe daquele cara afro vive me\N cantando, está virando um problema.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.66,0:19:49.41,Flashback,,0,0,0,,Acho que vou me demitir da loja pachinko.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.12,0:19:52.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Que coincidência.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.04,0:19:54.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Fiquei muito feliz de repente!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.54,0:19:56.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Querido, vamos voltar juntos!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.50,0:19:58.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Está bem!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.88,0:20:00.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Mojack, você também!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.35,0:20:13.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Mágica Kyouko, vamos voltar também.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.73,0:20:14.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Por mim tudo bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.07,0:20:23.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Calem-se!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.61,0:20:26.41,Main,,0,0,0,,Dança de rua em frente à minha loja?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.07,0:20:27.37,Main Alt,,0,0,0,,Nos desculpe! Nos desculpe! Nos desculpe!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.24,0:20:29.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Vou dançar também!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.25,0:20:40.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Com essa oportunidade,\N vamos atacar a Mágica Kyouko!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.05,0:20:46.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Mojack!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.01,0:20:52.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Desculpe!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.04,0:21:20.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Não importa o problema, eu resolvo queimando!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.76,0:21:35.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Hoje, para proteger a paz, a Mágica\N Kyouko lutou bravamente como sempre!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.46,0:22:03.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Rito, essa semana a Mágica\N Kyouko deu o seu melhor, né?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.71,0:22:05.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Ah, sim...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.81,0:23:44.15,Main,,0,0,0,,O hotel especializado em aliens, está aberto!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.15,0:23:45.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Do que está falando assim de repente?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.48,0:23:47.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Sempre quis ser recepcionista de um hotel!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.86,0:23:50.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Não é algo tão fácil!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.28,0:23:51.57,Main,,0,0,0,,E onde o hotel foi construído?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.57,0:23:53.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Não se preocupe. Usamos o antigo prédio da escola!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.82,0:23:55.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Tudo o que falta são hóspedes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.66,0:23:56.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Rito, você arruma umas pessoas!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.03,0:23:57.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Arrumo umas?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.95,0:24:01.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Pessoal, é barato! Muito barato! Venham ver!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.25,0:24:03.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Você pode experimentar uma noite!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.46,0:24:03.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Barato!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.91,0:24:05.17,Main,,0,0,0,,No próximo episódio de To LOVE-Ru:
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.17,0:24:06.33,Main,,0,0,0,,"O Sangrento Registro do Hotel Yuuki"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.33,0:24:09.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Aqui é assim, venha curtir a Terra!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,
